# `useBomManagedVersions --safe` replaces pinned versions with `*` but leaves marked (`=`, `^`, `~`) lines as is,
# reporting them under target/sbt-dependencies/bom-managed/<group>.md; the unrestricted run then adopts them too
# — version markers included — and leaves unpinned lines, BOM coordinates and already-`*` lines untouched. Running
# at the root aggregates over every project group.
> useBomManagedVersions --safe
> assertSafeRun
> useBomManagedVersions
> assertBomManaged
> reload
> compile
